      "content": "wait, i'm a bit confused. you keep using these goblin analogies—is there some kind of specific troubleshooting framework called \"goblin\" that i should be aware of for sensor diagnostics? i've never seen that used in oceanographic telemetry before.",
      "source": "evaluator"
